# The YM2608's timers and IRQ controls at the minimum fidelity: the IRQ
# enable at 0x29 with each timer masked and not, the flag control at 0x110
# masking a timer and resetting the flags, both status ports read (the
# first shows only the timers, the extended one updates the IRQ), busy,
# and a write to the data port paired with an upper address, ignored.
